Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa behold matching dire omens --- Rāma predicts slaughter of all rākṣasas --- Rāma orders Lakṣmaṇa to shelter Sītā in cave --- Lakṣmaṇa guards armed Sītā inside mountain cave --- Rāma dons armor and blazes like smokeless fire --- Terrified gods doubt lone Rāma against fourteen thousand --- Demon host surrounds Rāma roaring like ocean --- Rāma strings bow summoning fierce wrath for slaughter